WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.282
A long monthly product summary is usually convenient for charting.

00:00:04.282 --> 00:00:09.492
Each row contains a month, a product, and a measure such as revenue.

00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:15.787
A visualization tool can use month on the horizontal axis, revenue as the value,

00:00:15.787 --> 00:00:18.902
and product as a grouping or color category.

00:00:18.902 --> 00:00:24.617
New products and new months can appear as new rows without changing the table structure.
